   "data": {
    "text": "MUSIC & SOUND\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 8, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Score\n   2 Sound density\n   3 Sound against the cut\n   4 Music\n   5 No music\n   6 Sound around the scene\n   7 suite: Needle drop\n   8 suite: Ironic counterpoint\n   9 suite: Radio in the room\n  10 suite: Score swell\n  11 suite: Sudden silence\n  12 suite: Bare scene\n  13 suite: Suspense drone\n  14 suite: Montage song\n  15 suite: Returning theme\n  16 suite: Heightened sound\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 8, CC 17 to 28\n   1 pair: When the music is cut dead, a big line lands\n   2 pair: When the music drops out, a reveal follows\n   3 pair: When a famous song starts, time slows\n   4 pair: When the tempo rises, the cuts speed up\n   5 pair: When the music turns warm, faces soften\n   6 pair: When the music fights the scene, the violence gets bigger\n   7 pair: When there is no music, the frame gets closer\n   8 pair: When music plays in the room, someone moves to it\n   9 pair: When a theme returns, the character it belongs to appears\n  10 pair: When the music builds to its peak, it cuts out\n  11 pairs: Music steers the edit\n  12 pairs: Silence as a weapon"
